Protocol description:
    Start Bytes (0xAB, 0xCD)
    Destination Byte:
        0x01: USB
        0x02: ESP32
        0x03: GR 
    Command Byte (1 byte):
        0x01: data
        0x02: diagnostic GR
        0x03: diagnostic ESP32
        0x04: Mandelbrot
    Data Length (2 bytes): Length of the data payload
    Data Payload (up to 1023 bytes): Actual data being transmitted
    Checksum (2 bytes): Checksum for error detection




ESP32 Diagnostic:
    UtilisationKey: 0xB7

Mandelbrot initialisation:
    InitialisationKey: 0xB8
    RunKey: 0xB9
